#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:148
msgid "NeoChat will also now scan PDFs and other files sent to the chat for travel documents, and displaying all the relevant information directly in your conversation. All the processing is done on your device and no private information is sent to any third parties servers. Similarly your text documents will be directly displayed in the timeline."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:156
#: content/announcements/megarelease/6/index.md:0
msgid "Tokodon"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:158
msgid "[Tokodon](https://apps.kde.org/tokodon/) brings the Mastodon federated social media platform to your fingertips. With Tokodon you can read, post, and message easily. Now when writing a new post, it is possible to do that in a separate window, allowing you to continue using Tokodon while writing your post."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:163
msgid "![](tokodon.png)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:165
msgid "In this release, we also added a badge counter for follow requests in the sidebar."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:174
msgid "Kdenlive is KDE's full-featured video editor that gives you everything you need to build advertisements, documentaries, TV shows, and full-fledged movies."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:177
msgid "Version 24.05 adds Group Effects, effects that can be added to clips grouped together all at the same time. You can also reach wider audiences by using an offline AI that can translate your subtitles with the Automatic Subtitle Translations feature."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:182
msgid "The feature that allows you to capture audio from your desktop or microphone from directly within Kdenlive is back, and the performance of moving clips with the spacer tool has been hugely improved. The multiple resource bins management feature (bins being the areas where you keep your clips, images, titles and animations) has also been reworked and improved."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:196
msgid "[Elisa](https://apps.kde.org/elisa/) is KDE's elegant and feature-rich music player. Yet another improvement to its already sleek design is that this new version lets you switch between list and grid views."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:206
#: content/announcements/plasma/6/6.1.0.md:116
msgid "And all this too..."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:208
msgid "[Ark](https://apps.kde.org/ark/) helps you manage compressed files and archives. Ark can now open and un-archive self-extracting `.exe` archive files"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:211
msgid "![](https://invent.kde.org/utilities/ark/uploads/a2478ce699cbbceb89530420065fac4f/Screenshot_20240221_014525.png)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:213
msgid "The date and time picker in [Merkuro](https://apps.kde.org/merkuro.calendar/) has been updated and is now significantly faster."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:216
msgid "![](https://kontact.kde.org/blog/2024/2024-05-01-kde-pim-march-april-2024/images/merkuro.png)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:218
msgid "The reading experience on [Akregator](https://apps.kde.org/akregator/), KDE's RSS news reader, is more pleasant in this version thanks to a new layout and the support of dark themes."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:222
msgid "![Akgregator](akregator.png)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:0
msgid "KDE Gear 24.05.0"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:0
msgid ""
"It seems like yesterday when we released the Megarelease with apps included\n"
"in Gear 24.02. But, if you check your (Merkuro) calendars, you'll notice that\n"
"KDE developers have already put in three more months of intense work to bring\n"
"you a whole new set of improved versions of your favorite KDE applications.\n"
"\n"
"Read on to discover what's new in the Dolphin file manager,\n"
"Kdenlive video editor, Itinerary travel assistant, Elisa music player,\n"
"Kate text editor, and many more programs and utilities.\n"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:0
msgid ""
"Gear is growing! *Audex*, *Accessibility Inspector*, *Francis*, *Kalm* and\n"
"*Skladnik* are all joining the Gear releases, ensuring they will get a\n"
"sustained stream of updates from now on.\n"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:0
msgid "Audex"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:0
msgid ""
"[Audex](https://apps.kde.org/audex/) is a CD ripper application\n"
"that lets you copy your music CDs to your hard disk.\n"
