#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:0
msgid ""
"[Accessibility Inspector](https://apps.kde.org/accessibilityinspector/)\n"
"helps you check how accessible your application is.\n"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:0
msgid "accessibilityinspector"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:0
msgid "Francis"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:0
msgid ""
"[Francis](https://apps.kde.org/francis/) helps your productivity\n"
"by reminding you to take short breaks between focus phases using the\n"
"pomodoro technique.\n"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:0
msgid "francis"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:0
msgid "Kalm"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/gear/24.05.0.md:0
msgid ""
"Boost your wellness with [Kalm](https://apps.kde.org/kalm/) as it\n"
"guides you through various breathing techniques.\n"
