#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.11.95.md:104
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.12.0.md:94
msgid "The notification system gained support for interactive previews that allow you to quickly take a screenshot and drag it into a chat window, an email composer, or a web browser form. This way you never have to leave the application you’re currently working with."
msgstr "Agora o sistema de notificacións permite vistas previas interactivas que lle permiten sacar rapidamente unha captura de pantalla e arrastrala a unha xanela de charla, un editor de mensaxe ou un formulario dun navegador web. Así non ten que saír nunca da aplicación coa que está a traballar."

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.11.95.md:106
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.12.0.md:96
msgid "Task Manager Improvement"
msgstr "Mellora do xestor de tarefas"

