#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.11.95.md:128
msgid "Media controls have been added to the lock screen, which can be disabled since Plasma 5.12 for added privacy. Moreover, music will automatically pause when the system suspends."
msgstr "Engadíronse controis de reprodución na pantalla de bloqueo, que poden desactivarse desde Plasma 5.12 para maior protección da privacidade. Ademais, a música deterase automaticamente ao suspenderse o sistema."

