#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:47
msgid "Plasma now warns on logout when other users are logged in."
msgstr "Agora Plasma avisa ao saír cando outros usuarios teñen a sesión aberta."

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:50
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:48
msgid "The Breeze widget theme has improved shadows."
msgstr "Melloráronse as sombras do tema de trebellos Breeze."

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:51
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:49
msgid "<a href='https://blog.broulik.de/2018/03/gtk-global-menu/'>The Global menu now supports GTK applications.</a> This was a 'tech preview' in 5.13, but it now works out of the box in 5.14."
msgstr "<a href='https://blog.broulik.de/2018/03/gtk-global-menu/'>Agora o menú global é compatíbel con aplicacións GTK.</a> Isto era unha «vista previa de tecnoloxía» en 5.13, pero agora funciona sen máis en 5.14."

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:53
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:55
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:51
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:53
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.18.0.md:82
msgid "Plasma Discover"
msgstr "Plasma Discover"

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:57
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:55
msgid "Discover, our software and add-on installer, has more features and improves its look and feel."
msgstr "Discover, a noso instalador de software e complementos, ten máis funcionalidades e mellora a súa aparencia e comportamento."

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:59
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:57
msgid "Discover gained <i>fwupd</i> support, allowing it to upgrade your computer's firmware."
msgstr "Discover é compatíbel con <i>fwupd</i>, o que lle permite anovar o firmware do computador."

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:60
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:58
msgid "It gained support for Snap channels."
msgstr "Agora permite canles de Snap."

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:61
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:59
msgid "Discover can now display and sort apps by release date."
msgstr "Agora Discover pode amosar e ordenar aplicacións por data de publicación."

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:62
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:60
msgid "You can now see an app's package dependencies."
msgstr "Agora pode ver as dependencias dos paquetes das aplicacións."

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:63
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:61
msgid "When Discover is asked to install a standalone Flatpak file but the Flatpak backend is not installed, it now offers to first install the backend for you."
msgstr "Cando a Discover se lle solicita instalar un ficheiro independente de Flatpak pero a infraestrutura de Flatpak non está instalada, agora ofrece instalar antes a infraestrutura por vostede."

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:64
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:62
msgid "Discover now tells you when a package update will replace some packages with other ones."
msgstr "Agora Discover indícalle cando unha actualización de paquete substituirá algúns paquetes por outros."

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:65
msgid "We have added numerous minor user interface improvements: update button are disabled while checking for updates, there is visual consistency between settings and the update pages, updates are sorted by completion percentage, we have improved the review section of the update notifier plasmoid, etc.."
msgstr "Engadimos moitas pequenas melloras de interface de usuario: os botóns de actualización desactívanse mentres se comproba se hai actualizacións dispoñíbeis, hai unha consistencia visual entre a configuración e as páxinas de actualizacións, as actualizacións ordénanse por porcentaxe de completado, melloramos a sección de recensións do trebello de notificador de actualizacións, etc."

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:66
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:64
msgid "We have improved reliability and stability through a bunch of bug fixes."
msgstr "Melloramos a fiabilidade e estabilidade mediante varias correccións de fallos."

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:68
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:66
msgid "Improved KWin Glide Effect"
msgstr "Efecto de deslizamento mellorado en KWin"

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:70
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:68
msgid "KWin and Wayland:"
msgstr "KWin e Wayland:"

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:72
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:70
msgid "We fixed copy-paste between GTK and non-GTK apps on Wayland."
msgstr "Corriximos o copia e pega entre aplicacións GTK e non GTK en Wayland."

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:73
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:71
msgid "We fixed non-centered task switchers on Wayland."
msgstr "Corriximos os selectores de tarefas non centrados en Wayland."

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:74
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:72
msgid "We have improved pointer constraints."
msgstr "Melloramos as restricións de punteiros."

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:75
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:73
msgid "There are two new interfaces, XdgShell and XdgOutput, for integrating more apps with the desktop."
msgstr "Hai dúas interfaces novas, XdgShell e XdgOutput, para integrar máis aplicacións co escritorio."

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:76
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:74
msgid "We have considerably improved and polished KWin effects throughout, including completely rewriting the Dim Inactive effect, adding a new scale effect, rewriting the Glide effect, and more."
msgstr "Melloramos e pulimos os efectos de KWin en xeral, incluíndo reescribir completamente o efecto de «Escurecer as inactivas», engadir un novo efecto de escala, reescribir o efecto de «Deslizamento» e máis."

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:78
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:76
msgid "Bugfixes"
msgstr "Arranxos de erros"

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:80
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:78
msgid "We fixed many bugs, including:"
msgstr "Solucionamos moitos fallos, entre eles:"

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:82
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:80
msgid "Blurred backgrounds behind desktop context menus are no longer visually corrupted."
msgstr "Os fondos borrosos tras menús contextuais de escritorio xa non están visualmente corrompidos."

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.13.90.md:83
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.14.0.md:81
msgid "It's no longer possible to accidentally drag-and-drop task manager buttons into app windows."
msgstr "Xa non se pode arrastrar accidentalmente botóns do xestor de tarefas ás xanelas das aplicacións."

