#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.18.0.md:0
msgid "Plasma 5.18 adds an emoji selector, user feedback capabilties, a global edit mode and improves and expands System Settings, the Discover software manager, widgets, GTK integration and much more."
