#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.20.90.md:151
msgid "The compositing code in KWin has been extensively refactored and should reduce latency throughout all compositing operations. We have also added a control in the compositing settings so you can choose whether you prefer lower latency or smoother animations."
