#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.21.0.md:161
msgid "A firewall can help you protect your system from intrusion from outside or block information you want to keep private from leaving your machine. Plasma 5.21 provides a simplified way of configuring both UFW and firewalld, two of the most used firewall systems in Linux."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
