msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:19
msgid "To help KDE developers iron out bugs and solve issues, install Plasma 5.24 Beta and test run the features listed below. Please report bugs to our bug tracker."
msgstr ""

