#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:136
msgid "Fingerprint support has been added, letting you enroll and de-enroll fingers. Any of those fingers can be used to unlock the screen, provide authentication when an app asks for your password, and also authenticate `sudo` on the command line: [LINK](https://invent.kde.org/plasma/plasma-desktop/-/merge_requests/149)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:138
msgid "The Lock screen now lets you Sleep and Hibernate (if supported): [LINK](https://invent.kde.org/plasma/plasma-workspace/-/merge_requests/1122)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:146
msgid "Colors greater than 8-bit are now supported: [LINK](https://invent.kde.org/plasma/kwin/-/merge_requests/1641)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:147
msgid "There is a new drawing tablet page in System Settings: [LINK](https://invent.kde.org/plasma/plasma-desktop/-/merge_requests/677)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:148
msgid "“DRM leasing” support has been added, which allows us to re-add support for VR headsets with optimal performance: [LINK](https://invent.kde.org/plasma/kwin/-/merge_requests/662)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:149
msgid "Spectacle finally has access to the “Active Window” mode on Wayland: [LINK](https://bugs.kde.org/show_bug.cgi?id=386271)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:150
msgid "We added the concept of the “primary monitor”, which works like in the X11 session: [LINK](https://bugs.kde.org/show_bug.cgi?id=442158)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:151
msgid "The “Minimize All Windows” widget now has Wayland support: [LINK](https://invent.kde.org/plasma/plasma-desktop/-/merge_requests/732)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:152
msgid "The virtual keyboard now only appears when you explicitly focus a text-based UI control with a touch or stylus poke: [LINK](https://invent.kde.org/plasma/kwin/-/merge_requests/1517)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:153
msgid "When using a stylus, it is now possible to activate other windows from their titlebars and also just interact with more with titlebars in general: [LINK](https://bugs.kde.org/show_bug.cgi?id=432104)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:154
msgid "Restoring a minimized or maximized window now switches to the virtual desktop that the window was on before restoring it, instead of restoring it to the current virtual desktop: [LINK](https://invent.kde.org/plasma/plasma-workspace/-/merge_requests/549)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:155
msgid "You can now use the default <kbd>Meta</kbd>+<kbd>Tab</kbd> shortcut to cycle through more than two activities at a time: [LINK](https://bugs.kde.org/show_bug.cgi?id=397662)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:156
msgid "The System Tray item for showing and hiding the virtual keyboard becomes active only in tablet mode: [LINK](https://invent.kde.org/plasma/plasma-workspace/-/merge_requests/1335)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:162
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "General changes"
msgid "General Behavior"
msgstr "Cambios xerais"

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:164
msgid "It is now possible for Global Themes to specify and change Latte Dock layouts: [LINK](https://invent.kde.org/plasma/plasma-workspace/-/merge_requests/1243)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:165
msgid "Changing the color scheme now toggles the standardized FreeDesktop light/dark color scheme preference, so third-party apps that respect this preference will be able to automatically switch to light or dark mode based on your chosen color scheme: [LINK](https://invent.kde.org/plasma/xdg-desktop-portal-kde/-/merge_requests/49)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:166
msgid "Kate has been replaced with KWrite in the default set of favorite apps, since it is a bit more user-friendly and less programmer-centric: [LINK](https://invent.kde.org/plasma/plasma-desktop/-/merge_requests/704)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:167
msgid "The odd behavior of middle-clicking on a panel to create a sticky note has been disabled: [LINK](https://bugs.kde.org/show_bug.cgi?id=425852)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:168
msgid "The screen layout OSD now indicates screens’ scale factors in it: [LINK](https://invent.kde.org/plasma/kscreen/-/merge_requests/75)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:169
msgid "Scrollable controls in Plasma and other QtQuick-based apps now only change their contents when you start scrolling on them, preventing you from accidentally changing things while scrolling the view: [LINK](https://bugs.kde.org/show_bug.cgi?id=385270)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:170
msgid "Plasma now shuts down faster by no longer accepting new connections after it has begun the shutdown process, which particularly helps when using KDE Connect: [LINK](https://bugs.kde.org/show_bug.cgi?id=432643)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.23.90.md:172
msgid "If you would like to learn more, [check out the full changelog for Plasma 5.24 Beta](/announcements/changelogs/plasma/5/5.23.5-5.23.90)."
