msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:117
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:0
msgid "Colors"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:119
msgid "**Sync the accent color with your wallpaper!** The dominant color of your background picture can be applied to all components that use the accent color."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:123
msgid "Open *System Settings* and choose the *Appearance* tab, then *Colors*. Select *From current wallpaper* and click *Apply*. It is that easy."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:127
msgid "With **slideshow wallpapers**, colors update when the wallpaper changes."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:129
msgid "**Tint all colors of any color scheme using the accent color** and adapt the color of elements of every window to the background. **You can also choose how much tint you'd like to see** mixed in with your normal color scheme."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:135
msgid "Open *System Settings* and then click on the *Appearance* tab. Choose *Colors* and click on the *Edit* icon (the little pencil button) in the lower-right corner of a color scheme preview and a configuration dialogue will open. In the *Options* tab, tick the *Tint all colors with the accent colors* box and slide *Tint strength:* to the desired value. Click *Save as* and give your color scheme a new name. Click *Close*. Select your newly created color scheme and click *Apply*."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:139
msgid "While configuring your color scheme, you can also **make the header area or titlebar use the accent color**."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:145
msgid "Touch and Feel"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:147
msgid "**Activate Touch Mode** by detaching the screen, rotating it 360°, or enabling it manually."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:151
msgid "If your laptop supports detaching or rotating back the keyboard, do that now. *Touch Mode* will activate. If not, you can manually enable *Touch Mode* by opening *System Settings*, clicking on the *Workspace Behavior* tab, and selecting the *Touch Mode: Always Enabled* radio button at the end of the page."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:157
msgid "*The Task Manager* and the *System Tray* **become bigger** when in *Touch Mode* making it easier on your fingers. You can customize the size of the icons when *Touch Mode* is disabled, too."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:161
msgid "To manually increase icon spacing in the *Task Manager*, right-click the Task Manager and select *Configure Icons-Only Task Manager*. Select *Large* in the *Spacing between icons:* option. To manually increase the icon spacing in the *System Tray*, right-click on the *System Tray* and select *Configure System Tray*. Select *Large* in the *Panel icon spacing:* option."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:165
msgid "**Titlebars of KDE apps become taller when in Touch Mode**, making it easier to press, drag, and close windows with touch. **Context menu items become taller when in Touch Mode**, giving you more space to tap the correct one."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:167
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Update customization/ru"
msgid "Customization"
msgstr "Personalización de traducións/ru"

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:169
msgid "**Floating Panels** add a margin all around the panel to make it float, while animating it back to look normal when a window is maximized."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:175
msgid "Right-click the panel, select *Enter Edit Mode*, and then *More Options*. Select *Floating*."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:179
msgid "**Blend Effects** gracefully animate the transition when color schemes are changed."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:181
msgid "Move your entire desktop, with folders, widgets and panels, from one monitor to another with the **Containment Management window**."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:187
msgid "Right-click on the desktop and select *Enter Edit Mode*. Choose *Manage Desktop and Panels* from the top toolbar and drag and drop desktops or panels from one display to another, or click on their hamburger menu."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:197
msgid "**The Global Theme settings page lets you pick and choose which parts to apply** so you can apply only the parts of a global theme that you like best."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:199
msgid "**The Application page for Discover has been redesigned** and gives you links to the application's documentation and website, and shows what system resources it has access to."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:201
msgid "If you get your password wrong, the lock and login screens shake, giving you a visual cue to try again."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:205
msgid "**The KWin Scripts settings page has been rewritten** making it easier to manage your window manager scripts."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:207
msgid "**Plasma panels can now be navigated with the keyboard**, and you can assign custom shortcuts to focus individual panels."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.25.0.md:211
