#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.26.90.md:18
msgid "To help KDE developers iron out bugs and solve issues, install Plasma 5.27 Beta and test run the features listed below. Please report bugs to our [bug tracker](https://bugs.kde.org)."
