#. +> trunk5
#: content/announcements/plasma/5/5.26.90.md:28
msgid "Plasma Welcome introduces new users to the beauty and power of our desktop. It allows to perform inital setup tasks like connecting all your online accounts and suggests how to connect with the KDE Community."
