#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "\n"
#| "Moreover, hovering a music or video player shows beautiful album art and media controls, so you never have to leave the application you're currently working with. Our media controller applet that shows up during playback also received some updates, notably support for multiple players running simultaneously.\n"
msgid "Moreover, hovering a music or video player shows beautiful album art and media controls, so you never have to leave the application you're currently working with. Our media controller applet that shows up during playback also received some updates, notably support for multiple players running simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Ademais, cubrir un reprodutor de música ou de vídeo mostra a portada e controis de reprodución, para que non teña que saír nunca da aplicación coa que está a traballar. Tamén actualizamos o trebello de control da reprodución que se amosa durante a reprodución, principalmente permitindo varios reprodutores simultáneos.\n"

