msgid "Every day KDE contributors come up with new ideas for Plasma features, new applications, frameworks for developers, ways to maintain our software and fix bugs. All of this requires a constant influx of resources, and you can help!"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/fundraisers/plasma6member.md:15
msgid "You can become part of our community by [contributing your unique skills](https://community.kde.org/Get_Involved) and know-how, or by supporting us financially and becoming an official Supporting Member."
