#. +> trunk5
#: content/fundraisers/plasma6member.md:21
msgid "Generosity is at the heart of KDE and keeps our projects alive."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/fundraisers/plasma6member.md:23
msgid "It's what motivates our volunteers to share their time and knowledge to keep building new features and keeping KDE software up-to-date and secure."
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/fundraisers/plasma6member.md:26
msgid "Generosity also drives our supporters. Their contributions and sponsorships keep KDE's gears turning and ensure that our developers can continue their fantastic work."
msgstr ""

