#: content/fundraisers/plasma6member.md:30
msgid "How to Become a Supporter"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk5
#: content/fundraisers/plasma6member.md:32
msgid "Fill out the form and **for less than €10 a month** you too can support the champions who tirelessly improve our software every day. The KDE development ecosystem is a bustling hive of activity, and every supporting member helps keep it buzzing."
